; Re-exports matching the real d3d11.dll. Both forward straight through to
; the system DLL - the proxy only adds behavior via the IDXGISwapChain::
; Present hook installed inside D3D11CreateDevice(AndSwapChain).
;
; Deliberately NOT re-exported: D3D11CoreCreateDevice, D3D11CoreCreateLayered-
; Device, D3D11CoreGetLayeredDeviceSize, D3D11CoreRegisterLayers,
; D3D11On12CreateDevice. These are undocumented internal exports used by the
; OS driver stack (D3D11on12, layered drivers), essentially never called
; directly by games, and have no public prototype to wrap correctly. Games -
; including Watch Dogs (2014) - call D3D11CreateDevice/D3D11CreateDeviceAnd-
; SwapChain, which are the two that matter for this prototype.
LIBRARY d3d11

EXPORTS
    D3D11CreateDevice
    D3D11CreateDeviceAndSwapChain
